  "id": 203713278283944,
  "uuid": "95ab0f75-de4e-48b2-910a-e1442df2ce04",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "a4242920-e418-0a32-982c-bd407be821a5",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "97801b07-5344-b02a-6185-024d7e6b8e56",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The goal of the event was to showcase the Department's academic research activities, multiple disciplines, including cardiology, gastroenterology, general medicine, nephrology, neurology, oncology, endocrinology and pulmonology.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The forum provided an ideal platform for the promotion of medical research, especially patient-oriented research. Initiatives of this nature are expected to highlight the scientific content of medical practice in Pakistan. Translation of research into clinical practice is the ultimate goal of such endeavours and will lead to improvements in national health.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The retreat was attended by the AKU institutional leadership as well as by the Department of Medicine faculty and house staff in addition to AKU faculty from related disciplines.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Over 40 research papers were presented at the meeting, discussing advances in common clinical problems relevant to Pakistan, including hypertension, cardiovascular disease, diabetes, tuberculosis, hepatitis, and cancer.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
